#: ../../source/xmlbuilder_CHANGELOG.md:50
msgid ""
"Removed `doctype` function to prevent name clash with DOM implementation."
" Use the `dtd` function instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xmlbuilder_CHANGELOG.md:51
msgid ""
"Removed dummy nodes from the XML tree (Those were created while chain-"
"building the tree)."
