#: ../../source/xmlbuilder_CHANGELOG.md:52
msgid ""
"Renamed `attributes`property to `attribs` to prevent name clash with DOM "
"property with the same name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/xmlbuilder_CHANGELOG.md:53
msgid ""
"Implemented the DOM standard (read-only) to support XPath lookups. XML "
"namespaces are not currently supported. See "
"[#122](https://github.com/oozcitak/xmlbuilder-js/issues/122)."
msgstr ""

